            "review_title": "Review at Nom Thit Bo Kho",
            "review_text": "Rish M\n26 contributions\n0\nBest vietnamese summer rolls!\nAug 2024 • Friends\nOur street food guide Jenny took us here and it was a fantastic experience. We had the \"Nộm bò khô\" (dried beef salad with papaya) and \"Nem nướng\" ( Vietnamese summer rolls) which were so good that we bought rice paper to make the rolls back home. A must visit in Hanoi.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 25, 2024",
