            "review_text": "PnP Wiz\n41 contributions\n0\nNom Thit Bo Kho\nMar 2018 • Friends\nExcellent street food like a fast food on a street side. Quick services and great taste. This is another version of papaya salad to Thai, and this Vietnamese version from many years ago. The prices are very reasonable. They do have different choices from the menu beside the beef yerky, and you can order the papaya salad with roasted quail or even with sour ham or plain with just fish sauce. A great salad meal or a meal with a varieties from the menu. We had the salad with beef jerky, with roasted quail, shrimp bread flour cake, and sour ham. We did try out everything, and everything was excellent. If you go on the weekend, then you have to seat out on the street due to the crowded of people. Need to try it if you have a chance.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 10, 2018",
